正在烤 你应该能闻到
which you will smell warming right now...

547
00:17:52,860 --> 00:17:56,180
租电影《忘情巴黎》花了3块
...$3 for the "Forget Paris" rental.

548
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:59,640
你还找到了我们以前喜欢的瓶装红酒
Aw, you even found cans of the wine we used to like.

549
00:17:59,780 --> 00:18:01,640
你真的选得很成功
You completely nailed it.

550
00:18:01,720 --> 00:18:03,280
我知道 太成功了
I know. I really did!

551
00:18:03,280 --> 00:18:04,258
我成功了 我成功了
I did! I did!

552
00:18:04,258 --> 00:18:06,559
这也是我第一次成功
And it was the first time ever.

553
00:18:06,580 --> 00:18:07,000
而且...
And...

554
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:09,116
我好希望这感觉能一直不散
I really want this feeling to last.

555
00:18:09,116 --> 00:18:10,360
如果我要求你
Would it be weird if I asked you

556
00:18:10,360 --> 00:18:11,800
明天再给我礼物 会不会很奇怪
not to give me your gift until tomorrow?

557
00:18:12,180 --> 00:18:13,820
-满足你 -太棒了
- You got it. - Yes!

558
00:18:14,340 --> 00:18:15,680
其实呢 我可能
In fact, I might, uh --

559
00:18:15,740 --> 00:18:17,480
我可能会偷偷跑去把这个礼物给换掉
I might sneak off and trade this in

560
00:18:17,480 --> 00:18:18,840
换成个很烂的东西
for something really terrible

561
00:18:18,840 --> 00:18:20,200
让你更显大获全胜
just to seal your victory.

562
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:21,160
好了
All right.

563
00:18:21,620 --> 00:18:23,540
现在让派对正式开始吧
Now let's get this party started.

564
00:18:24,263 --> 00:18:25,201
不会吧
No. Mm.

565
00:18:25,220 --> 00:18:27,740
我以前为你做的精选集吗
The old mixtape I made you?

566
00:18:27,840 --> 00:18:31,059
没错 "菲尔之调合集"
Oh, yeah. "Songs in the key of Phil."

567
00:18:31,059 --> 00:18:32,295
糟糕
Oh, no! Oh. Oh.

568
00:18:32,408 --> 00:18:34,090
糟糕 等等
Aw, no. Wait, hang on.

569
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:36,520
-卷不回去了 -没事啦
- It's not going back in. - You know what?

570
00:18:36,520 --> 00:18:38,180
有时候不听音乐也挺好的
Sometimes it's nice to not have music.

571
00:18:40,031 --> 00:18:41,964
我才不要整晚听那个
Well, I'm not listening to that all night.

572
00:18:43,580 --> 00:18:48,020
不知道当年的"对讲机系统"还好用不
I wonder if the old intercom system still works.

573
00:18:48,040 --> 00:18:48,920
想起来了
Oh, yeah!

574
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:49,919
没错
Yeah.

575
00:18:49,919 --> 00:18:50,958
狠狠地说他们
Give it to 'em.

576
00:18:50,958 --> 00:18:52,735
挥洒我的情绪
Tell 'em how I feel.

577
00:18:58,440 --> 00:18:59,580
天啊
Oh, my God!

578
00:18:59,780 --> 00:19:02,140
没事的 没事 不用紧张
It's okay! Okay. No need to be alarmed.

579
00:19:03,240 --> 00:19:04,900
鱼柳条别焦了啊
Oh, no, not the fish sticks!

580
00:19:08,080 --> 00:19:10,920
菲尔 打开窗烟雾警报就会停了
Oh, oh, Phil? Open the window, and it'll stop the alarm!

581
00:19:13,014 --> 00:19:15,660
-天啊 救命 -没事的
- Oh, God! Whoa! Oh, God! - Oh, it's okay!

582
00:19:15,660 --> 00:19:17,658
-菲尔 菲尔 -我来救你
- Phil! Phil! - Oh! I got you!

583
00:19:17,658 --> 00:19:19,114
-好 -我来救你
- Okay. - I got you!

584
00:19:19,560 --> 00:19:22,324
天啊 天啊 天啊
Oh, God. oh, God. Oh, God. Oh, God.

585
00:19:22,324 --> 00:19:23,321
天啊 天啊
Oh, God. Oh, God.

586
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:25,240
红酒可燃吗
Wine is flammable?!

587
00:19:25,380 --> 00:19:26,740
不可 但这种可以
No! But that is!

588
00:19:26,940 --> 00:19:27,840
救命啊
Oh, God.

589
00:19:31,560 --> 00:19:32,080
我了个浣熊
Raccoons!

590
00:19:32,520 --> 00:19:34,840
求你了 要骂脏话就用大人用的词
Oh, for God's sake, Phil, just swear like an adult.

591
00:19:34,980 --> 00:19:35,500
不是
No!

592
00:19:36,720 --> 00:19:38,980
我内心的某个部分早料到我有天会这么死
Part of me always knew this is how I was gonna go out.

593
00:19:39,120 --> 00:19:41,580
被浣熊围绕 死在红酒火灾中吗
In a wine fire surrounded by raccoons?

594
00:19:41,800 --> 00:19:42,280
等等
Wait.

595
00:19:47,080 --> 00:19:48,460
这是什么
What is that?

596
00:19:50,940 --> 00:19:52,400
我的天啊
Oh, my goodness.

597
00:19:52,660 --> 00:19:53,340
太赞了
Oh, yes.

598
00:19:54,257 --> 00:19:55,612
这又是什么
What -- what is this?

599
00:20:00,980 --> 00:20:02,420
太厉害了
Oh, yes!

600
00:20:04,569 --> 00:20:07,300
-还不快滚 -你也给老子闭嘴
- Yeah! Get out! - You shut your mouth!

601
00:20:07,300 --> 00:20:08,340
爽啊
Oh, yeah!

602
00:20:08,860 --> 00:20:11,800
既然我们的邻居听不懂暗示
And since the neighbors can't take a hint.

603
00:20:12,340 --> 00:20:14,380
这真是太屌了
That was amazing.

604
00:20:14,380 --> 00:20:15,700
亲爱的老婆
My dear,

605
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:18,490
送给你最好的礼物
nothing but the best for you...

606
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:21,120
来纪念我们的结婚纪念日
...on our anniversary.

607
00:20:21,798 --> 00:20:22,692
来
Now...

608
00:20:24,980 --> 00:20:26,420
刚才说到哪了
...where were we?

609
00:20:34,030 --> 00:20:36,120
能赏脸跳这支舞吗
May I have this dance?

610
00:20:36,460 --> 00:20:37,000
可以
Yes.

611
00:20:39,380 --> 00:20:41,860
我真是世界上最幸运的女孩
I am the luckiest girl in the world.

612
00:20:44,089 --> 00:20:46,470
你结婚纪念日要送我拖...
Did you get me a mop for our --

613
00:20:52,340 --> 00:20:53,460
给点力啊
Come on.

614
00:20:53,800 --> 00:20:54,640
亲爱的 怎么了
Honey, what happened?

615
00:20:55,020 --> 00:20:56,220
我弄撒了一点牛奶
I spilled some milk.

616
00:20:56,560 --> 00:20:58,620
结果这拖把什么都能 就是不能拖地
Apparently the only thing this mop can't do is mop.

617
00:20:58,900 --> 00:21:00,878
为此难过也没用
Well, there's no use crying over it.

618
00:21:00,878 --> 00:21:02,260
直接打给他们投诉吧
Just call them and complain.

619
00:21:02,260 --> 00:21:03,080
你说得对
Oh, you're right.

620
00:21:04,205 --> 00:21:05,900
我是您的紧急拖把专员
This is your emergency moperator.

621
00:21:05,900 --> 00:21:06,520
有何能为您效劳呢
How can I help?

622
00:21:06,840 --> 00:21:10,280
我拖把的拖地功能坏了
The mop function on my mop isn't working.

623
00:21:10,280 --> 00:21:11,819
我深感抱歉
I'm sorry to hear that,

624
00:21:11,819 --> 00:21:13,967
我这就远端帮您重启拖把
I'm gonna go ahead and do you a remote reset.

625
00:21:13,967 --> 00:21:16,431
您可能会发现拖把温度变得极高
You may notice your mop gets extremly hot.

626
00:21:17,400 --> 00:21:18,140
我应该...
Should I...?

627
00:21:18,140 --> 00:21:18,940
我开玩笑的
I'm kidding.

628
00:21:19,579 --> 00:21:21,169
拖把专员 这个玩笑好
Good one moperator.

629
00:21:21,169 --> 00:21:22,789
真希望你能看到他刚才的表情
You should've seen his face.

630
00:21:22,789 --> 00:21:25,139
我看到了 你们真是一对有爱的夫妇
I did. You are an adorable couple.

631
00:21:25,139 --> 00:21:26,460
-扔了它 -我这就...
- I rid of it. - I'm...
